:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Zangief (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Zangief''' is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Zangief
|image = E 483.png
|first appearance = [[Iron Cyclone (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Zangrief, though not the fastest, possesses moderate damage that is greatly compounded by his rapid attacks and high health. Despite his low range, his Omni Strikes hits up to 260, which combined with his immunity to knockback/freeze/slow/weaken and singular knockback makes him a serious threat.

==Strategy==
Take him out with [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] or long ranged units and don't use crowd controllers. Alternatively, you can use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-red]] attackers to exploit his red trait.

